{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 9043244171381878185,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Issue Assignment",
      "source_hash": 18136179676808172286,
      "context_hash": 9476186601693281599,
      "translation": "이슈 배정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:35.898107Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The issue assignment commands allows any user to assign themselves to a GitHub issue.",
      "source_hash": 13086849681197139619,
      "context_hash": 11411547367120789713,
      "translation": "이슈 배정 명령어는 모든 사용자가 자신을 GitHub 이슈에 배정할 수 있게 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:35.898108Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Usage",
      "source_hash": 8769925957682373409,
      "context_hash": 3748040676221020904,
      "translation": "사용법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:35.898108Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Issue assignment is done by entering one of these commands in a GitHub comment:",
      "source_hash": 6484497699302294905,
      "context_hash": 12270303759938439647,
      "translation": "이슈 배정은 GitHub 댓글에 다음 명령어 중 하나를 입력하여 수행합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:35.898108Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "`@rustbot claim` --- Assigns the issue to yourself.",
      "source_hash": 5815520843310911790,
      "context_hash": 2690951052685879204,
      "translation": "`@rustbot claim` --- 이슈를 자신에게 배정합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:35.898109Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "`@rustbot release-assignment` or `@rustbot unclaim` --- Removes the current assignee.",
      "source_hash": 8871233472128974448,
      "context_hash": 12394928117448981579,
      "translation": "`@rustbot release-assignment` 또는 `@rustbot unclaim` --- 현재 담당자를 제거합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:35.898109Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "Only the current assignee or a team member can release an assignment.",
      "source_hash": 6038924654991816856,
      "context_hash": 5484453084707078202,
      "translation": "현재 담당자 또는 팀 구성원만 배정을 해제할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "team member": "팀 구성원"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:17:44.268438Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "`@rustbot assign @user` --- Assigns a specific user.",
      "source_hash": 17236264771041276290,
      "context_hash": 630403435312950975,
      "translation": "`@rustbot assign @user` --- 특정 사용자를 배정합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:35.898109Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "Only team members can assign other users.",
      "source_hash": 2351777479363018565,
      "context_hash": 16562849612263207643,
      "translation": "팀원만 다른 사용자를 배정할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:35.898109Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Due to GitHub restrictions, not all users can be directly assigned to an issue.",
      "source_hash": 3913705813373299337,
      "context_hash": 10425185058400684060,
      "translation": "GitHub 제약으로 인해 모든 사용자가 이슈에 직접 배정될 수 있는 것은 아닙니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:35.898109Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "Only users with write permission to the repo, or rust-lang organization members can be directly assigned.",
      "source_hash": 2292693066541282127,
      "context_hash": 3334414789882075444,
      "translation": "저장소에 쓰기 권한이 있는 사용자 또는 rust-lang 조직 구성원만 직접 배정될 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Rust": "Rust"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:17:44.268439Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:2",
      "source": "If triagebot is unable to directly assign the user, it will instead assign `@rustbot` and edit the top-level comment with a message that the issue has been claimed.",
      "source_hash": 7900225193231583968,
      "context_hash": 14770151501990470263,
      "translation": "triagebot이 사용자를 직접 배정할 수 없는 경우, 대신 `@rustbot`을 배정하고 이슈가 클레임되었다는 메시지로 최상위 댓글을 수정합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈",
        "triagebot": "triagebot"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:17:44.268439Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Configuration",
      "source_hash": 4935613502183038470,
      "context_hash": 2928013424497877852,
      "translation": "설정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:35.898110Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "[!NOTE] This feature is [enabled by default](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/master/rust-lang.triagebot.toml) in the rust-lang organization.",
      "source_hash": 17648849861768685535,
      "context_hash": 1281146410892032517,
      "translation": "[!NOTE] 이 기능은 rust-lang 조직에서 [기본적으로 활성화되어 있습니다](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/master/rust-lang.triagebot.toml).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Rust": "Rust"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:17:44.268442Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Issue assignment is enabled on a repository by the existence of the `[assign]` table in `triagebot.toml`:",
      "source_hash": 6853627369690712848,
      "context_hash": 5155831482035546712,
      "translation": "이슈 배정은 `triagebot.toml`에 `[assign]` 테이블이 존재함으로써 저장소에서 활성화됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:35.898110Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Implementation",
      "source_hash": 14188291987651099077,
      "context_hash": 10015035246740256498,
      "translation": "구현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:35.898110Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "See [`parser/src/command/assign.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/parser/src/command/assign.rs) and [`src/handlers/assign.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/assign.rs).",
      "source_hash": 3206907669066900486,
      "context_hash": 5801226501789644448,
      "translation": "[`parser/src/command/assign.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/parser/src/command/assign.rs) 및 [`src/handlers/assign.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/assign.rs)를 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:35.898110Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}